# Managed voice runtime for the packaged desktop app.
#
# These are the union of pyproject.toml's voice, voice-streaming and
# voice-output extras. The desktop payload does not contain them: the app
# installs them on demand from the per-target, hash-locked voice-<target>.txt
# files generated from this input by scripts/desktop_shell/voice_lock.py.
# Keep every specifier identical to its pyproject.toml extra.
